# Source of truth for the published patterns: the form inventory and the full
# adjudication trail. Tracked, and shipped in the sdist so the pipeline can be
# rerun from an unpacked archive. The adjudication trail is tracked compressed as
# tests/data/review_decisions.sqlite.xz; slabika.review.packed unpacks the
# working copy next to it on demand and packs changes back.
